        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Mulligan, James Foley, Andrew Smith, Ken Finkleman\n- Works: Who's That Girl, To Kill a Mockingbird, Summer of '42, The Other, Same Time, Next Year, The Man in the Moon\n- Roles: film director, television director, screenwriter\n- Topics: American film, screwball comedy\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Patrick Mulligan was born on August 23, 1925, and was an American film and television director.\n- Robert Mulligan was best known for directing humanistic American dramas including To Kill a Mockingbird (1962), Summer of '42 (1971), The Other (1972), Same Time, Next Year (1978), and The Man in the Moon (1991).\n- James Foley was born on December 28, 1953, and is an American film director.\n- Who's That Girl is a 1987 American screwball comedy film.\n- Who's That Girl was written by Andrew Smith and Ken Finkleman.\n- James Foley directed Who's That Girl.\n- Robert Patrick Mulligan died on December 20, 2008.",
